stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loaded
    Loaded --> Active : game starts
    Active --> ItemProgress : player collects item
    ItemProgress --> Active
    Active --> LevelCleared : remaining items = 0
    LevelCleared --> NextLevel : more levels exist
    LevelCleared --> GameWon : no more levels
    Active --> PlayerDefeated : player lives = 0
    PlayerDefeated --> GameOver
